@host = http://localhost:5080

### UTCP manual
GET {{host}}/utcp

### OpenAPI document
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json

### Weather
GET {{host}}/weather/Seattle?days=3

### Create order
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "product": "Widget", "quantity": 2 }

### Current user (requires bearer token)
GET {{host}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
